# The wheel carries the package alone. The source distribution carries what a
# reader needs to reproduce the paper's numbers: the catalogues, the tests that
# lock them, the worked examples with the USGS catalogues they run on, the numbers
# the paper's tables are drawn from, the browser tool, the user guide and the
# design record. The tests run the user guide's examples on those catalogues, so
# the distribution has to carry both.
include LICENSE CITATION.cff README.md
recursive-include tests *.py *.csv
recursive-include examples *.py *.toml *.csv
recursive-include docs *.md *.json
recursive-include web *.html
